        <h4 class="heading-59"><strong class="bold-text-3" data-cms="story.title" data-cms-label="Title">Our Story</strong></h4>
        <div class="text-block-80" data-cms="story.text" data-cms-label="Story text">Founded in Chennai in 2024, Cloutgency was built on a simple belief. To go above and beyond for every single client. From day one, we believed that brands don&#x27;t need to change who they are, they need to change who sees them. With the leaders of tomorrow encapsulating the digital space, Cloutgency was born with a mission to spearhead the world of social media, websites and everything in between.<br><br>That’s why we work less like a traditional agency and more like a growth engine with a startup mindset. We break businesses down the way investors do - market, audience, positioning, margins, opportunity - and then put creativity to work where it matters.<br><br>We don’t chase content for the sake of content. We build stories people stay for, brands people remember, websites that convert, and marketing designed to move.<br><br>Because at the end of the day, we’re not here to sell deliverables. We’re here to help brands win.</div>
